#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-nexus.rst:5 f8b9bae2a95e4b688f22881fc1818e20
msgid "mRo Nexus"
msgstr "mRo Nexus"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-nexus.rst:7 a549af4e6d7f46bb93320a6e425ca4c7
msgid ""
"The `mRo Nexus <https://store.mrobotics.io>`__ is new member of mRo's "
"Pixracer autopilot family."
msgstr "`mRo Nexus <https://store.mrobotics.io>`__ 是 mRo Pixracer 飞控系列的新成员。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-nexus.rst:18 c8d05eba321a4a398fe5d80cc4379cbb
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-nexus.rst:20 356d844ba1a54ccaa58cd3be6d8d0119
msgid ""
"The `mRo Nexus <https://store.mrobotics.io>`__ is a member of the next "
"generation of mRobotics' family of Pixracer autopilots. It has been designed"
" for ultra compact applications which primarily use CAN peripherals, as well"
" as standard GPS/Compass or Airspeed sensors. It includes an integrated "
"ADS-B receiver for avoidance."
msgstr ""
"`mRo Nexus <https://store.mrobotics.io>`__ 是 mRobotics Pixracer "
"飞控下一代系列的成员。它专为主要使用 CAN 外设以及标准 GPS/罗盘或空速传感器的超紧凑应用而设计。它集成了 ADS-B 接收机用于避障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-nexus.rst:25 f2ded9dfc311471a9ca5ab7d62a3dacb
msgid ""
"At time of writing the autopilot is still being evolved/improved. The final "
"version may very slightly from the information provided here."
msgstr "撰写本文时，该飞控仍在持续发展/改进中。最终版本可能与此处提供的信息略有不同。"

